    "en": "Shelly Pro 3EM, Shelly EM Gen3, Lixee ZLinky_TIC, Ecojoko, Tibber Pulse P1 and frient EMI 2 LED compared: current clamps or Linky TIC, P1 port, solar tracking, Home Assistant and electrician installation.",
